  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raw Materials for a Just Transition in Latin America and the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;The Multi-Donor Action &#xBF;Raw Materials for a Just Transition in Latin America&#xBF; is jointly co-financed by the European Union (EU) and the Federal Ministry for Economic Cooperation and Development (BMZ) and implemented by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Deutsche Gesellschaft f&#xFC;r Internationale Zusammenarbeit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; (GIZ) as part of the BMZ project &#xBF;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Rohstoffe f&#xFC;r eine Just Transition in Lateinamerika&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&#xBF;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; (impact) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;of the Action is to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;promote sustainable and inclusive economic growth through an EU-LAC Partnership approach. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Specific Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; (outcome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;) of the Action is that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;the mining of raw materials for the energy transition in Latin America and the Caribbean is oriented towards a Just Transition, in the sense of a social-ecological and globally just economic transformation. This ambition is put into practice through five outputs: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;enhanced expertise on approaches on increased value addition in mining; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;improved ability of governments and civil society to continue to efficient revenue management in the mining sector; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;strengthened capacities of relevant actors to reduce negative environmental impacts from the mining sector; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;strengthened implementation of human rights in the mining sector, especially in participatory decision making and gender equality; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;developed marked-oriented vocational training and professional training concepts for the mining sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
